## Complete API Endpoints

```
POST   /auth/signup          — Create account
POST   /auth/login           — Get JWT token
GET    /users/me             — Current user (protected)

POST   /spots/               — Create spot (protected)
GET    /spots/               — List all (filter by ?category=)
GET    /spots/search/?q=     — Search by name/description/category
GET    /spots/saved/mine     — My saved spots (protected)
GET    /spots/{id}           — Get one spot
PUT    /spots/{id}           — Update (protected, creator only)
DELETE /spots/{id}           — Delete (protected, creator only)
POST   /spots/{id}/save      — Save to collection (protected)
DELETE /spots/{id}/save      — Remove from collection (protected)
```

